A wave of natural energies flow around you in a radius of [2, 4, 5, 5, 6 (TL1-5)].  All creatures in the area will be affected by the Healing Nexus effect for [5, 6, 7, 8, 9 (TL1-5)] turns.

On you, this effect causes each heal received to restore [5, 6, 7, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] equilibrium and be [135%, 147%, 155%, 160%, 164% (TL1-5)] effective.

On other creatures, all healing is intercepted and redirected to you at [35%, 47%, 55%, 60%, 64% (TL1-5)] efficiency.

Only direct healing (not normal regeneration) is affected.
